#. Tag: title
#: bookmarks.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: bookmarks.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bookmarks are invisible placeholders that allow you to move easily to "
"specified points in a large document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some other wordprocessors have bookmarks as part of their interface. If you "
"are familiar with their use, you will find that &kword; functions in a "
"similar manner."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It should be noted that bookmarks are attached to the <emphasis>text</"
"emphasis> near the cursor, not the page location. If the text moves forward "
"or backward in the document (as text is inserted or deleted respectively), "
"the bookmark moves with the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: bookmarks.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new bookmark"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a bookark is simple."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Place the cursor where you want the bookmark to be inserted. Select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Insert</guimenu><guimenuitem>Bookmark...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "A small dialog box will appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type a short description of the bookmark location (i.e. Chapter 1, Appendix, "
"Abstract, etc). This description will identify the bookmark for you."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to create the bookmark."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> to return to your document without "
"creating a bookmark."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: bookmarks.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jump to a previously created bookmark"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To jump to a previously created bookmark, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Select Bookmark...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A small dialog will appear. Double click on the desired bookmark with the "
"&LMB;. You will immediately be taken to the location in the document that is "
"attached to that bookmark."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can click once on the desired bookmark with the &LMB;, "
"and then click on <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. This will function the same as "
"double clicking on the bookmark."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: bookmarks.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rename a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To rename a bookmark, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Select Bookmark...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A small dialog will appear. Click on the desired bookmark with the &LMB;. "
"Now click <guibutton>Rename Bookmark</guibutton>. A small dialog will "
"appear. Enter the new name for your bookmark. Click <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>. The bookmark is renamed immediately."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: bookmarks.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a bookmark, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Select Bookmark...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "A small dialog will appear. Click on the desired bookmark with the &LMB;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be sure you have selected the correct bookmark from the list before "
"proceeding. &kword; does not ask for confirmation before deleting the "
"selected bookmark."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: bookmarks.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now click <guibutton>Delete Bookmark</guibutton>. The bookmark is deleted "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

